netpoisson (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Replace the example utility with a Poisson traffic tester.
  * Echo requests unchanged and answer STATUS with server timelines and
    queues.
  * Show scrolling Req/Resp lines, a JSON report, and a live web
    dashboard.
  * Align packaging with zephyr style: noarch RPM, Architecture all,
    scripts/, i18nutil.
  * Split peer I/O into netio_sock, peer_server, and peer_client
    modules.
  * Add L1 whole-document man translations and install them under
    mandir/<locale>/man1.
  * Install locale man pages into DESTDIR instead of absolute /usr
    paths.

 -- Lenik (谢继雷) <lenik@bodz.net>  Mon, 21 Sep 2026 13:38:12 +0800

